MODULE: StagingNamesBoundLogRetainOldStage
TARGET: StagingNamesBoundLog
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a successful physical rebind carries the retired WAL's staged prepare into the new generation
PERTURBS: Install

--- FIND
    /\ read' = floor /\ checkpoint' = floor
    /\ staged' = FALSE /\ stageOrigin' = 0
--- REPLACE
    /\ read' = floor /\ checkpoint' = floor
    /\ staged' = staged /\ stageOrigin' = stageOrigin
--- END
